{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"复向量丛"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“复向量丛”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>复向量丛是以 $GL_n(\\mathbb{C})$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"结构群","text":"结构群"}},{"Plain":"的 $\\mathbb{C}^n$ 丛.</p>\n"}]}}